OL,3,GNEWSABrain cancer patients demand
OL,4,Apublic inquiry into chemotherapy
OL,5,Ascandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrain cancer patients who were given
OL,8,Fyears of unnecessary chemotherapy are
OL,9,Fcalling for a public inquiry, after a
OL,10,Freview found people were severely
OL,11,Fharmed under an NHS trust's care.
OL,13,FSome were misdiagnosed while others
OL,14,Fwere told if they stopped temozolomide
OL,15,F(TMZ) treatment they would die, despite
OL,16,Fthis not being true.
OL,18,FThe Royal College of Physicians (RCP)
OL,19,Finvestigated 20 cases at University
OL,20,FHospitals Coventry and Warwickshire
OL,21,F(UHCW) NHS Trust.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
