OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1795006573
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSABrain cancer patients demand
OL,4,Apublic inquiry into chemotherapy
OL,5,Ascandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe drug is typically meant to be taken
OL,8,Ffor six months but in one case a
OL,9,Fpatient of Prof Ian Brown was given
OL,10,Fmore than 100 cycles of chemotherapy
OL,11,Fover a period of 13 years. They later
OL,12,Fdeveloped leukaemia as a side-effect of
OL,13,Ftoo much chemotherapy.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
